Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Give the Lightkeeper's desk the investigator's
 navigation, and requests a page of their own

Issue #66.3 (decision 2) and #66.1 (decision 6).

One navigation for both desks: the left rail of torn slips and the phone's
strip of four slips are gone. As on the investigator's desk, below xl the
title header carries Back to chapter hub and Account, and the Lightkeeper's
Desk bar under it carries the tabs (Roster, Circle, Notebook, Map and
Requests); from xl the bar is the one slim band with the campaign's name and
code, the tabs and the way out behind a rule. Below md the bar is a slim band
held at the top with the die and the drawer pull, and the drawer
(pc/DeskDrawer.jsx, now taking its slips as a prop) shows one part at a time:
Roster, Circle, Notebook, Map, Join requests, then Dice and log, Pass notes,
Dispatch and Hourglass, with the table strip under the band as on the
player's phone. Retire lies on the account card at every size. Every page
and paper of the desk is where it was otherwise; the table strip runs across
the top of the desk where the hourglass is out of sight.

Join requests leave the front of the desk: the Requests page holds them with
the pager, Approve, View sheet, Reject and Invite player, and its tab (and
the drawer's slip and Menu) counts the requests waiting. A request the
Lightkeeper has not been shown pops up at the foot of the screen
(gm/desk/JoinRequestPopup.jsx) with the same card, All requests and Later;
the ids shown are kept per campaign in this browser, so a request pops up
once and none is lost on a reload. DESIGN.md and FAQ.md describe both.

Checked in Chromium: every tab at 1366x768, the bar at 1280x720 and
1920x1080 (no sideways scroll), the Requests page and Invite player at
820x1180, every drawer page and the account card's Retire at 390x844, and
1024x768, 1180x820 and 844x390. A request sent while the desk showed the
Notebook popped up and was approved from it; Later then a reload brought no
pop-up while the tab still counted the request. The player's desk and drawer
are unchanged at 390x844, 820x1180, 1024x768 and 1366x768. No page errors.

